			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance Cocoon formatting and Mountain dashboard helpers\n\nUpdate the Element submodule to commit e56eef10, incorporating refinements from the Cocoon and Mountain submodules.\n\nThe Cocoon update (8c25ad5a) standardizes the `UriKey` utility by formatting the `fsPath` conditional return statement, improving code consistency without altering logic. The Mountain update (e4c272b2) introduces `DashboardHelpers` under the `PerformanceDashboard` IPC module, adding stub utilities for process memory, CPU usage, and UUID generation, alongside a helper to map metric types to display strings.\n\nThese changes align the extension host and native backend with project coding standards and establish the foundational layer for future performance monitoring integration.\n\nRefs e56eef10595c5b6ed53e39aacc7a77a6cfef7b23",
			"SHA": "d9c579f246e0a633391f00fcd4d3f785271bec6f"
